  "probes": [],
  "notes": "Video, before colour — where the video reel demo ends, with the colour modules placed but unpatched.\n\nCoordinate Field on radius, quantised into bands, tiled, twisted and scrolling; Shapes keeping everything above a slice of it; the picture on Video Output. Encoder, Chroma and Colorizer sit on the second row with nothing in them.\n\nThis is the opening rack for the colour demo. Open \"Video — colour\" to see where it ends up.",
